        "location": "place_projectile_plane",
        "predicate": "pred_projectile_flight_anim",
        "instruction": {
          "title": "Observe independent horizontal and vertical motion",
          "description": "Launch the projectile and follow the live component arrows. The horizontal velocity component remains constant, while the vertical component decreases on the way up, becomes zero at maximum height, and increases downward during descent. The trail reveals a parabola. Learning objective: describe how horizontal velocity, vertical velocity, and position change during flight, and identify maximum height as the point where vertical velocity is zero."
        },
